        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARHYD, Parthenon Plate With Hyde Park Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Parthenon Plate With Hyde Park Porcelain Knob has an elaborate yet graceful victorian design. The simple shape of the Hyde Park Knob draws attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. The Parthenon Plate features luxurious detailing that exudes richness. This knobset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home decors. These Decorative Porcelain Door Knobs are ideal for an authentic house restoration, or simply to make a distinctive decorative statement on your doors. From Grandeur's Parthenon collection the pure white solid porcelain knobs are offered with solid forged brass decorative back plates in your choice of six gorgeous finish colors. This Grandeur Interior Set will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARHYD Parthenon Plate With Hyde Park Porcelain Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Parthenon Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Hyde Park Knob is made out of porcelain.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Plate With Hyde Park Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Hyde Park Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Hyde Park Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-PARHYD-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262185\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur PARHYD Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
