                "description": "Parthenon Plate With Hyde Park Knob Grandeur PARHYD - The Parthenon Plate With Hyde Park Porcelain Knob has an elaborate yet graceful victorian design. The simple to the beautiful detailing on the rose. The Parthenon Plate features luxurious detailing that exudes richness. This knobset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home decors. These Decorative Porcelain Door Knobs are ideal for an authentic house restoration, or simply to make a distinctive decorative statement on your doors. From Grandeur's Parthenon collection the pure white solid porcelain knobs are offered with solid forged brass decorative back plates in your choice of six gorgeous finish colors. This Grandeur Interior Set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
